    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n9802" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀντιβᾰτικός</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ή</span>,
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">όν</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>contrary, opposite,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φορά</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plu.
					<u>Phoc.</u>
					2
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> of contact,
				<i>firm, thorough,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-κωτέρα ἡ κατὰ τὴν κίνησιν τοῦ
					οὐρανίου σώματος ἁφή</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Simp.
					<u>in Cael.</u>
					440.19
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				9
			</span></i>; <i>resistent,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Hierocl.
				p.23A.
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Alex.Aphr.
				<u>Quaest.</u>
				62.4
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Olymp.
				<u>in Mete.</u>
				18.30
			</span></i>; of the pulse, <i><span class="en">
				Gal.
				8.949
			</span></i>, cf.<i><span class="en">
				644
			</span></i>. Adv.
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-κῶς</span> ib.<i><span class="en">
				668
			</span></i>: 
				Comp.
			, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κλίνησ-κώτερον ἐστρωμένης</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Sor.
					2.61
				</span></i>
			.</div>
